{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Behold, I am about to cause it to hail.</b> It is known that even today no hail or rain falls upon Egypt, and there is no need to explain why this is so and similarly in other places to this day. And because of this they feared a great fear, for nothing fell there except in the manner of dew."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:56.262643234Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}